OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 15 MAR
OL,4,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,5,     GIggy returns with a sonic
OL,6,     Gcocktail to soundtrack your
OL,7,     GSunday afternoon. This week, he's
OL,8,     Ggot key cuts by the likes of
OL,9,     GKleenex, Stereolab, The Who,
OL,10,     GEthel Cain, Mogwai and more.
OL,11,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,12,     GArtist Sue Webster selects her
OL,13,     GEnd of Days choice, the piece of
OL,14,     Gmusic she would like to leave to
OL,15,     Gfuture generations by Siouxsie
OL,16,     Gand the Banshees, the band who
OL,17,     Gshaped her youth.
OL,18,G2000FStuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,19,     GStuart's featured album is the
OL,20,     GMardi Gras voodoo jazz swamp
OL,21,     Gritual classic Gris Gris by Dr.
OL,22,     GJohn the Night Tripper.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
